<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00399">
	<title>Paddle shifter</title>
	<shortdesc>Use the paddle shifters to adjust the regenerative braking level from 0 to 3 during deceleration.</shortdesc>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>regenerative braking system 
					<indexterm>paddle shifter</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
				<indexterm>paddle shifter</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e02828">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e02829">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV045010.eps" align="center" placement="break" height="1.575in" width="2.244in" id="e02830"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e02831">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOVQ015036.eps" align="center" placement="break" height="1.575in" width="2.244in" id="e02832"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul id="e02833">
			<li>
				<p>Pull the left side (<image href="../../images/WKIA_291.eps" align="left" scale="15" placement="inline" outputclass="nolabel" id="e02834"/>) of the paddle shifter to increase regenerative braking and deceleration.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Pull the right side (<image href="../../images/WKIA_292.eps" align="left" scale="15" placement="inline" outputclass="nolabel" id="e02835"/>) of the paddle shifter to decrease regenerative braking and deceleration.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>The selected regenerative braking level will be displayed on the instrument cluster.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<note type="note" id="e02836">
			<ul id="e02837">
				<li>
					<p>The regenerative braking level is set before the vehicle is turned off.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>If the level is set to 0, it will automatically return to level 1 when the vehicle is restarted.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Initial setting of the regenerative braking level and adjustable range vary according to the selected drive mode.</p>
					<table frame="all" outputclass="formatc" rowsep="1" colsep="1" pgwide="0" id="e02838">
						<desc>
							<p importance="default">: for GT</p>
						</desc>
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="1.122*"/>
							<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="1.122*"/>
							<thead>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<p>Drive mode</p>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<p>Adjustable range</p>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</thead>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p> <term translate="no">ECO</term> </p>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p>0-3</p>
									</entry>
								</row>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p> <term translate="no">NORMAL</term> </p>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p>0-3</p>
									</entry>
								</row>
								<row>
									<entry colname="col1" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p> <term translate="no">SPORT</term> </p>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p>0-3</p>
									</entry>
								</row>
								<row rowsep="0">
									<entry colname="col1" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p> <term translate="no">SNOW</term> </p>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p>0-1</p>
									</entry>
								</row>
								<row>
									<entry colname="col1" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p> <term translate="no">MY DRIVE</term> </p>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p>0-3</p>
									</entry>
								</row>
								<row>
									<entry colname="col1" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p> <term>GT*</term> </p>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2" align="center" valign="middle">
										<p>0-3</p>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</note>
		<section id="e02839">
			<title>Non-operating conditions</title>
			<ul id="e02840">
				<li>
					<p>Both the left (<image href="../../images/WKIA_291.eps" align="left" scale="15" placement="inline" outputclass="nolabel" id="e02841"/>) and right (<image href="../../images/WKIA_292.eps" align="left" scale="15" placement="inline" outputclass="nolabel" id="e02842"/>) side of the paddle shifters are pulled simultaneously.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Smart Cruise Control (SCC) is active.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>The vehicle’s high-voltage battery is fully charged (100%).</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>